<body>
         <p><hi rend="decor">IS</hi> and do ḟīa<expan>rfaig</expan> 
    <name type="person" nymRef="E15">Eoch<expan>aid</expan> L<expan>et</expan>hd<expan>er</expan>g</name>, rī <name type="place" nymRef="l1">Laig<expan>en</expan></name>, 
    do <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Chaílti</expan></name>: ‘c<expan>r</expan>ēt fod<expan>er</expan>a 
    d’<name type="person" nymRef="64">Ḟin<expan>n</expan></name> ⁊ do<expan>n</expan> ḟēin<expan>n</expan> gan in pēisd atā acain<expan>n</expan> 
    a <name type="place" nymRef="g19">nGlen<expan>n</expan> Ruis En<expan>aig</expan>h</name> do mha<expan>r</expan>b<expan>ad</expan> 
    s<expan>e</expan>ch g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> n-a<expan>r</expan>r<expan>acht</expan> eli da<expan>r</expan> dhīchuir sibh 
    a h<name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>inn</expan></name>?’.</p>
    
  <p>‘IS <expan>ed</expan> fod<expan>er</expan>a si<expan>n</expan>’, ar <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>, 
    ‘i<expan>n</expan> ceathram<expan>a</expan>d ran<expan>n</expan> d’i<expan>n</expan>chin<expan>n</expan> 
    <name type="person" nymRef="M28">Mes Ged<expan>r</expan>a</name> hī ⁊ ro sluic i<expan>n</expan> tal<expan>am</expan>h an<expan>n</expan> hī 
    <expan>co n</expan>d<expan>er</expan>na pēisd adbul di, ⁊ nī raibhi a <expan>n</expan>dān dūin<expan>n</expan>e a [m]a<expan>r</expan>b<expan>ad</expan> 
    no gu toirs<expan>ed</expan>h an <name type="person" nymRef="P1">Tāilc<expan>en</expan>d</name> et deiscib<expan>ul</expan> dā <expan>mhuindtir</expan> 
    cengl<expan>as</expan> d’ǣ<expan>n</expan>sifinn lūac<expan>r</expan>a ar d<expan>ered</expan>h na haims<expan>er</expan>i hí ⁊ biaidh isi<expan>n</expan> 
    cengal soi<expan>n</expan> co tī …’</p>
    
         <p>‘Cidh uma tēigdis an ḟīan dá ma<expan>r</expan>bad fēi<expan>n</expan> a<expan>r</expan>an loch si<expan>n</expan> don phēisd?’.</p>
         <p><hi rend="decor">‘</hi>Lean<expan>n</expan>ān sīdh, ♠ [.i.] <name type="person" nymRef="U2">Ūai<expan>n</expan>e <expan>inghen</expan> 
    Modhuir<expan>n</expan></name>, ⁊ t<expan>u</expan>c <name type="person" nymRef="F64"><expan>Find</expan></name> éra [...] imat 
          d’ilre<expan>cht</expan>aibh a tēighedh s[...] <pb edRef="Lis204" n="fol.217r"/><cb edRef="Lis204" n="fol.217ra"/> ná tēig<expan>e</expan>d-si richt</p>
         <p>⁊ tāncat<expan>ar</expan> an fīan lāithi n-āen a<expan>r</expan>i<expan>n</expan> ca<expan>r</expan>n ōs cin<expan>n</expan> in locha 
    si<expan>n</expan> ⁊ tāi<expan>n</expan>ic i<expan>n</expan> fīadh am<expan>a</expan>ch a<expan>r</expan>i<expan>n</expan> loch ⁊ 
    do lensa<expan>m</expan>-ne a<expan>r</expan>in lo<expan>c</expan>h hé; ⁊ do ēir<expan>ig</expan> i<expan>n</expan> pēisd dūin[n] ⁊ 
    do <expan>m</expan>a<expan>r</expan>bh cēd cū ⁊ .c. f<expan>er</expan> acain<expan>n</expan>.</p>

         <p>Et do fīaf<expan>r</expan>aighi<expan>us</expan>-sa d’<name type="person" nymRef="F64">Ḟin<expan>n</expan></name> in lin<expan>n</expan> 
    taethsadh i<expan>n</expan> phēist ⁊ dām<expan>a</expan>d edh co cuir<expan>m</expan>is f<expan>r</expan>ia ⁊ <expan>co n</expan>dīghlaimis 
    ar <expan>muindter</expan> uirri.</p>

         <p>Et t<expan>u</expan>c <name type="person" nymRef="F64"><expan>Find</expan></name> a o<expan>r</expan>d<expan>ain</expan> foa dh<expan>éd</expan> 
    <expan>fis</expan> ⁊ do foillsig<expan>e</expan>d fīr fāitsi<expan>n</expan>e dhó. ⁊ at-b<expan>er</expan>t:</p>


<p xml:id="Lis204_poem62"><lg type="quatrain" n="1">
    <l><name type="place" nymRef="g19"><hi rend="decor">“Gleand</hi> Rois Ena<expan>ig</expan></name> bīdh dha<expan>m</expan></l>
<l>bidh bin<expan>n</expan> guth cluic an<expan>n</expan> na<expan>ch</expan> tan</l>
<l>gē bheth fo damhaibh rūadha</l>
<l>robs<expan>a</expan>t ile a a<expan>r</expan>dbūadha.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="2">
<l>Ro ghabh in doi<expan>n</expan>ean<expan>n</expan> dub<expan>ad</expan>h / dub<expan>ac</expan>h</l>
<l>Nī soi<expan>n</expan>ean<expan>n</expan> <expan>acht</expan> a<expan>r</expan> sealuibh</l>
<l>do g<expan>a</expan>b an tal<expan>am</expan> tothall (tal<expan>amh</expan> trothall / trochall / torthall)</l>
  <l>do ghabh cochall cen<expan>n</expan> enuigh.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="3">
<l>Eanach fēn<expan>n</expan>e fadbh ful<expan>aig</expan>h</l>
<l>i<expan>m</expan>rulaibh ga<expan>r</expan>bh re co<expan>n</expan>uibh</l>
<l>Sīat s<expan>r</expan>otha ealta enaigh</l>
<l>Rīan t<expan>r</expan>eaghai<expan>n</expan> terca troghain.</l></lg>
           
  <lg type="quatrain" n="4"><pb xml:id="Stokes_p.69"/> 
<l>C<expan>r</expan>otholl fēn<expan>n</expan>e fūath cu<expan>r</expan>ra<expan>ig</expan>h</l>
<l>ōs duill<expan>ib</expan> rūadha ri<expan>n</expan>dibh</l>
<l>Sceō gǣithi ceō tar glen<expan>n</expan>uibh</l>
<l>ōs rengaibh leab<expan>r</expan>a a<expan>r</expan> lindibh.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="5">
<l>Cosc<expan>r</expan>ach at-cīu-sa in mu<expan>r</expan>bhigh</l>
<l><expan>r</expan>osc d<expan>r</expan>eacoin b<expan>r</expan>ath ta<expan>r</expan> buidnibh</l>
<l>tǣbhūai<expan>n</expan>e taitn<expan>em</expan> taidhlibh</l>
<l>biaid ic Cǣimgi<expan>n</expan> a cuibr<expan>e</expan>ch.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="6">
<l>Muirb<expan>e</expan>c<expan>h</expan> lon<expan>n</expan> <name type="place" nymRef="l48">Locha Ena<expan>ig</expan></name></l>
<l>ton<expan>n</expan> ’na deg<expan>aid</expan>h ad<expan>r</expan>aidhe.</l>
<l>sisi ac slaighi na fēne.</l>
<l>óic na <expan>féinne</expan> ’ga sl<expan>aig</expan>i.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="7"> 
<l>Deich mblīadhna f<expan>or</expan> dhā blīad<expan>ain</expan></l>
<l>a hocht rīag<expan>ail</expan> a<expan>r</expan> rēal<expan>aig</expan></l>
<l>a<expan>r</expan> dā cēd dēc sēt sǣire</l>
<l>c<expan>us</expan>an aī<expan>n</expan>e fa<expan>r</expan>gēnai<expan>r</expan>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="8">   
<l><name type="place" nymRef="l48">Loch nEnuigh</name> adba ealach</l>
<l>scīth<note><p>Scíath scrite ar dtúis, ach cuimlíodh an ‘a’.</p></note> cen ḟīan<expan>n</expan>a ’na ḟa<expan>r</expan>r<expan>a</expan>d</l>
<l>tāilgin<expan>n</expan> <expan>con</expan>-taghf<expan>a</expan>t / <expan>co</expan> taghf<expan>a</expan>t i<expan>m</expan>me</l></lg>
<l>bidh bi<expan>n</expan>de canf<expan>a</expan>t amha<expan>r</expan>.</l>

  <lg type="quatrain" n="9">
<l><name type="place" nymRef="l48">Loch nEn<expan>aig</expan></name> adhbha eala</l>
<l>Din<expan>n</expan> mB<expan>ērr</expan>a (?) id<expan>er</expan> dā b<expan>r</expan>oine</l>
<l>enach t<expan>r</expan>oghai<expan>n</expan> Blaī thēite</l>
<l>ō thā i<expan>n</expan> cēte co aroile.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="10">
<l><name type="place" nymRef="g19">Glen<expan>n</expan> En<expan>aig</expan></name> id<expan>er</expan> dhā sl<expan>íab</expan></l>
<l>as ē is āilli at-co<expan>n</expan>na<expan>r</expan>c rīamh</l>
<l>abhun<expan>n</expan> dā loch a<expan>r</expan>a lār</l>
<l>isin lān don l<expan>eit</expan>h anīa<expan>r</expan>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="11"> 
<l>Bidh adhbha ailithr<expan>e</expan>c<expan>h</expan> ūa<expan>r</expan></l>
<l>bidh adhbha t<expan>r</expan>ūagh nā bo tend.</l>
<l>bidh adhn<expan>acht</expan> rīgh cen<expan>n</expan> a c[<expan>e</expan>]<expan>nn</expan>.</l>
<l>ticfa Cǣimgei<expan>n</expan> isi<expan>n</expan> gl<expan>enn</expan>”. <expan>Gleand</expan>.</l></lg></p>


     <p>Cidh t<expan>r</expan>ā nī hēid<expan>er</expan> ārimh i<expan>n</expan> neoch ro i<expan>n</expan>niseta<expan>r</expan> do dēnam dhōibh 
fēi<expan>n</expan> ⁊ do mhaithaib na <expan>féinne</expan> do mōirgnīmaib gaili ⁊ <expan>gaiscid</expan> re tǣbh dhin<expan>n</expan>ṡenchais 
ca<expan>ch</expan> cnuic ⁊ ca<expan>ch</expan> f<expan>er</expan>ui<expan>n</expan>n ro ḟīa<expan>rfaighetur</expan> fir 
<name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> dībh.</p>
  
  <p><hi rend="decor">IS</hi> andsi<expan>n</expan> tāi<expan>n</expan>ic <name type="person" nymRef="T6">T<expan>r</expan>ēnbhrug<expan>aid</expan>h 
m<expan>a</expan>c <expan>r</expan>eōi<expan>n</expan></name>, .i. flathbhrug<expan>aid</expan> <expan>céd</expan>ach co<expan>m</expan>ram<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan>,   
do rīgh Ēir<expan>enn</expan> ⁊ .lll. f<expan>er</expan> mōr ’na ḟarr<expan>ad</expan> ⁊ faid<expan>er</expan>ān fīrghor<expan>m</expan> um 
g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> f<expan>er</expan> díb ⁊ lēi<expan>n</expan>ti līghda lāi<expan>n</expan>geala i<expan>m</expan>paibh ⁊ .lll. 
gabal-lorg ’na lā<expan>m</expan>uibh. Ben<expan>naig</expan>hid / Ben<expan>nac</expan>h<expan>a</expan>id do rīgh
<name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> ⁊ f<expan>r</expan>eac<expan>r</expan>ais-siu<expan>m</expan> īat:</p>

  
  <p>‘Atā fl<expan>ed</expan> mhōr acai<expan>n</expan>n d<expan>ui</expan>t [...]t</p>

  <p>.i. .x. <expan>fichit</expan> dab<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> do mhig, ⁊ .x. <expan>fichit</expan> d[ab]<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan>
 do cuir<expan>m</expan> glai<expan>n</expan> [...]aigh <expan>con</expan>a ndāeth<expan>ain</expan> do bīadh<expan>aib</expan> ila<expan>r</expan>
 dha écsamhla [...]agh ⁊ i<expan>n</expan> li<expan>n</expan>n leō do<expan>n</expan> rīg.</p>
  
  <p>Do fīa<expan>rfaig</expan> rī <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">d’Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>:
 ‘[...]th<expan>ib</expan>h <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> raghthai-si [...] i<expan>n</expan> 
  t<expan>e</expan>c<expan>h</expan> ōil ⁊ aībnesa [...]?’.</p>

  <p>‘A<expan>r</expan> cuid bídh ⁊ <expan>lenn</expan>a a<expan>r</expan> l<expan>eith</expan> dūi<expan>n</expan>’, a<expan>r</expan> 
 <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>, <cb edRef="Lis204" n="fol.217rb1"/> ‘ōr nī lucht coimhdí<expan>n</expan>e 
 nā co<expan>m</expan>aims<expan>er</expan>i dhūi<expan>n</expan> nā daī[<expan>n</expan>]e anois’.</p>

  <p>‘Cā lín atāithe?’, a<expan>r</expan> in rīgh.</p>

  <p>‘Dā nǣnb<expan>ar</expan>’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>, ‘.i. nǣnb<expan>ar</expan> 
    da<expan>m</expan>-sa ⁊ n<expan>ǣn</expan>b<expan>ar</expan> do<expan>m</expan>’ <pb xml:id="Stokes_p.70"/> co<expan>m</expan>alta, 
 do <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Caīl<expan>ti</expan></name>’.</p>

  <p>‘Fiche dab<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> <expan>con</expan>a ndǣth<expan>ain</expan> bīdh dhaībh’, ol in rī.</p>
  
  <p>‘Maith, a rī’, ar <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>, ‘nā cut<expan>r</expan>amaigh-si sin<expan>n</expan> do biudh ná 
 do lin<expan>n</expan></p>

  <p>ōr i<expan>n</expan> tan do-b<expan>ér</expan>tha .x. ndabhcha da<expan>m</expan>-sa .xxx. dabhach b<expan>ud</expan>h chōir 
 <name type="person" nymRef="O2">dh’Oisí<expan>n</expan></name>’.</p>
  
  <p>Do caiths<expan>e</expan>t in ag<expan>aig</expan> si<expan>n</expan> co sub<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> 
 som[e]<expan>nm</expan>[n]<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> gan uiresb<expan>aid</expan> <expan>bídh</expan> ná <expan>dighe</expan>.</p>
  
  <p>Do ēirg<expan>etur</expan> na sl<expan>úaig</expan> a<expan>r</expan>namhār<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> ⁊ do cuir<expan>e</expan>d a 
 pup<expan>all</expan> ta<expan>r</expan> rīgh <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> isin tul<expan>aig</expan>, 
 ⁊ nír’ lēic<expan>et</expan> <expan>acht</expan> rī <expan>nó</expan> rīgdamna isi<expan>n</expan> pup<expan>all</expan> ⁊ t<expan>u</expan>cadh 
 <name type="person" nymRef="P1"><expan>Pátraic</expan></name> <expan>con</expan>a clērch<expan>aib</expan> isin da<expan>r</expan>a l<expan>eit</expan>h 
 do<expan>n</expan> phub<expan>all</expan>, ⁊ nīr’ lēcedh <expan>acht</expan> escap <expan>nó</expan> saca<expan>r</expan>t <expan>nó</expan> 
 m<expan>a</expan>c o<expan>c</expan>hta do Rīgh Nimhe ⁊ Talm<expan>an</expan> isin l<expan>eit</expan>h i raibhi <expan>Pátraic</expan>.</p>

  <p>Suidhis <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name> a fīadn<expan>uis</expan>i <name type="person" nymRef="P1"><expan>Pátraic</expan></name>
 ⁊ <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name> a fīad<expan>nais</expan>i rīg <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name>:</p>
  
  <l>‘Cīa acuib as si<expan>n</expan>e?’, ol in rī.</l>

  <p>‘Misi’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>, ‘ōr .xxx. bl<expan>íadhan</expan> ba sl<expan>ān</expan> 
 da<expan>m</expan> in tan ruc<expan>a</expan>d <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>, ⁊ .uii. mbl<expan>íadna</expan> déc dhō 
 am’ leabaidh-si ⁊ as mu tigh ro ghabh ḟēin<expan>n</expan> ⁊ ḟoirind’.</p>
  
  <p>IS andsi<expan>n</expan> do fīa<expan>rfaig</expan> rī <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name>: ‘cā lí<expan>n</expan> 
 do rīguib <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> lasa t<expan>u</expan>cad f<expan>er</expan>an<expan>n</expan> 
 don ḟēin<expan>n</expan>?’.</p>
  
  <p>Freg<expan>r</expan>ais <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name> si<expan>n</expan> ōr do baī a ḟis aigi: ‘rī 
ro gab<expan>us</expan>t<expan>ur</expan> <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>inn</expan></name>, .i. 
<name type="person" nymRef="F21">F<expan>er</expan>adhuch Fe<expan>cht</expan>n<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan></name>, ⁊ do bāt<expan>ar</expan> 
dā m<expan>a</expan>c aigi, .i. <name type="person" nymRef="T15">Tūath<expan>al</expan></name> ⁊ <name type="person" nymRef="F46">Fīacha</name>; 
⁊ fūai<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="F21">F<expan>er</expan>ud<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan></name> <expan>bás</expan> ⁊ 
do roi<expan>n</expan>nset a dhā m<expan>a</expan>c <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>inn</expan></name><note><p>Tuiseal Cuspóireach?</p></note> 
et<expan>o</expan>rra: .i. a seōit ⁊ a maí<expan>n</expan>e ⁊ a hin<expan>n</expan>mh<expan>us</expan>a, a būa<expan>r</expan> ⁊ a bó thāinte, 
a dūi<expan>n</expan>ti ⁊ a di<expan>n</expan>gn<expan>a</expan>da don da<expan>r</expan>a f<expan>er</expan>. A halla ⁊ 
a hi<expan>n</expan>db<expan>er</expan>a, a mes ⁊ a mōrthor<expan>a</expan>d, a heicn<expan>e</expan>da ailli eochai<expan>r</expan>b<expan>r</expan>eaca, 
a fīad<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> ⁊ a fīancosc<expan>ur</expan> do<expan>n</expan> fi<expan>r</expan> aili’.</p>

  <p>‘Cáit a nd<expan>er</expan>ns<expan>a</expan>t in roi<expan>n</expan>n si<expan>n</expan>?’, a<expan>r</expan> 
<name type="person" nymRef="D25">Dīa<expan>r</expan>m<expan>ait</expan></name>.</p>
  
  <p>‘i<expan>m</expan>on cnoc so a<expan>r</expan> a fuilm<expan>i</expan>t ’na<expan>r</expan> suidhi’, 
    a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Caílti</expan></name>.</p>

  <p>‘Nī samhalta i<expan>n</expan> dā roi<expan>nn</expan> si<expan>n</expan>’, a<expan>r</expan> m<expan>a</expan>the 
    bhf<expan>er</expan> <name type="place" nymRef="e6">nĒir<expan>enn</expan></name>.</p>

  <p>‘Cīa dībh roin<expan>n</expan> b<expan>ud</expan>h f<expan>er</expan>r lib-si?’, 
a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>.</p>

  <p>‘A fleagha ⁊ a tighi ⁊ a maithi<expan>us</expan> a<expan>r</expan>c<expan>en</expan>a’. a<expan>r</expan> sīat.</p>

  <p>‘I<expan>n</expan> roin<expan>n</expan> b<expan>ud</expan>h mesa leō-san’, a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Caīl<expan>ti</expan></name>,
 ‘as ī b<expan>ud</expan>h f<expan>er</expan>r li<expan>n</expan>de’.</p>

  <p>‘Rāidh ⁊ in<expan>n</expan>is a firin<expan>n</expan>i sūt, a <name type="person" nymRef="C6"><expan>Chaílti</expan></name>’, 
    a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>. ⁊ as-b<expan>er</expan>t-s<expan>um</expan>:</p>


<p xml:id="Laud610_poem63"><lg type="quatrain" n="1">
<l>‘Rāidh a <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Chaīl<expan>ti</expan></name>, cid dīa fuil</l>
<l>mōr n-eoluis re ḟia<expan>rfaigid</expan>?</l>
 <l><expan>céd</expan>roi<expan>nn</expan> <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> l<expan>et</expan><note><p>Dúch caite.</p></note> 
    a<expan>r</expan> l<expan>eit</expan>h,</l>
<l>do g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> crīch fil im <name type="place" nymRef="u3">Uisnech’</name>.</l></lg>

  <lg type="quatrain" n="2"><pb xml:id="Stokes_p.71"/>
<l>Cīa do-r<expan>a</expan>t ḟeran<expan>n</expan> do<expan>n</expan> ḟěin<expan>n</expan>?</l>
<l>i<expan>n</expan> ab<expan>r</expan>ai f<expan>r</expan>im, a <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisēi<expan>n</expan></name>?</l>
<l>Cīa do sca<expan>r</expan> re gill<expan>acht</expan> <expan>con</expan>?</l>
<l>Cīa ros-dīl fa thūa<expan>r</expan>astiol?’.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="3"> 
<l>‘Meabh<expan>air</expan> lim, i<expan>n</expan> ní dīa fuil,</l>
<l>a me<expan>i</expan>c <expan>inghen</expan>i in D<expan>eir</expan>g d<expan>r</expan>uin</l>
<l>ō<note><p>Tá an lámhscríbhinn creimthe</p></note> lesaigh <name type="person" nymRef="F46">Fīacha</name> i<expan>n</expan> fēi<expan>n</expan></l>
<l>c<expan>ur</expan> ro t<expan>r</expan>ēig<expan>e</expan>d thū a <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Ois[éin]</name>.
    <note><p>Dúch caite agus lacuna sa lámhscríbhinn.</p>
</note></l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="4">
<l>Deich mbl<expan>íadna</expan> do fl<expan>aith</expan>i<expan>us</expan> mhaith</l>
<l>d<expan>ui</expan>t-si, a <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>, a [ardḟlaith]
  <note><p>Dúch caite agus lacuna sa lámhscríbhinn.</p></note></l>
<l>b<expan>r</expan>ēg fa <name type="person" nymRef="F17">Fath<expan>ad</expan></name> i<expan>n</expan> fēi<expan>n</expan></l>
  <l>cu ro t<expan>r</expan>ēicset tū <name type="person" nymRef="O2">[a Oissein]</name>’.
    <note><p>Lacuna sa lámhscríbhinn.</p></note></l></lg>
     
<lg type="quatrain" n="5">
<l>‘Degm<expan>a</expan>c <name type="person" n="F21">F<expan>er</expan>adhuigh</name>, da<expan>r</expan> lim,</l>
<l>da<expan>r</expan>bo [chomhainm <name type="person" nymRef="F46">Fiacha</name>]
    <note><p>Dúch caite agus lacuna sa lámhscríbhinn.</p></note></l>
  <l><pb edRef="Lis204" n="fol.217v"/><cb edRef="Lis204" n="fol.217va"/><name type="person" nymRef="E50">Eithne <expan>inghen</expan> Dai<expan>r</expan>e Dhuibh</name></l>
<l>in mhōr-rīghan a māthai<expan>r</expan>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="6">
<l><name type="person" n="F21">F<expan>er</expan>ad<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan></name> is <name type="person" nymRef="F46">Fīacha [F]i<expan>n</expan>d</name></l>
<l>roi<expan>n</expan>nset <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>inn</expan></name>
    <note><p>Scrite go hidirlíneach.</p></note>, ti<expan>n</expan>d a ti<expan>n</expan>d,</l>
<l>bātar f<expan>or</expan> <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>inn</expan></name> co mblag</l>
<l>gan chogad, gan co<expan>m</expan>ardadh.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="7">
<l>Ruc do ragha i<expan>n</expan> m<expan>a</expan>c ba só</l>
<l>be<expan>t</expan>h re fēin<expan>n</expan>, nī hi<expan>m</expan>a<expan>r</expan>gō,</l>
<l>aibhne fāsaigi,<note><p>Lámhscríbhinn caite.</p></note> f<expan>ed</expan>ha.</l>
<l>⁊ alla is i<expan>n</expan>nb<expan>er</expan>a.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="8">
<l>Ro g<expan>a</expan>b <name type="person" n="F21">F<expan>er</expan>ad<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan></name>, da<expan>r</expan> lim,
    <note><p>Lámhscríbhinn caite.</p></note></l>
<l>ai<expan>r</expan>d<expan>r</expan>īgi a<expan>r</expan> f<expan>er</expan>uibh <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name></l>
<l>a fl<expan>ed</expan>ha, a tai<expan>r</expan>thi,<note><p>Lámhscríbhinn caite.</p></note> a tighi;</l>
<l>a tāi<expan>n</expan>ti ’s a [tre]aba<expan>r</expan>i.<note><p>Lámhscríbhinn caite.</p></note></l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="9"> 
<l>Rīghi <name type="person" nymRef="F21">Fe<expan>r</expan>aduig</name><note><p>Lámhscríbhinn caite.</p></note> ba maith,</l>
<l>cor’ thuit le <name type="person" nymRef="M20">Māl</name> i<expan>n</expan> mōrḟlaith<note><p>Tá an dúch ídithe.</p></note></l>
<l>ba tāsc rīgh, do rūamn<expan>a</expan>d<note><p>Lámhscríbhinn caite.</p></note> gail,</l>
  <l>bās na flāta <name type="person" nymRef="F21">F<expan>er</expan>ad<expan>uig</expan></name>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="10"> 
<l>Luidh <name type="person" nymRef="F46">Fīacha</name> a <name type="place" nymRef="t8">Temr<expan>aig</expan></name> co rath</l>
<l>ō do-rochai<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="F21">F<expan>er</expan>adach</name></l>
<l>gab<expan>uis</expan> nertt <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> uili,<note><p>Lámhscríbhinn caite.</p></note></l>
  <l>a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="M20">Māl Mór mac Rochraidi</name>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="11">
