<l>a bhḟaisnēis ’na bhfilidhecht</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="30">
<l>Cai<expan>r</expan>b<expan>r</expan>e file, fūai<expan>r</expan> da<expan>r</expan> lea<expan>r</expan>,</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="A79">Amhai<expan>r</expan>gin</name> <name type="place" nymRef="i18">"In<expan>n</expan>si Gǣīg<expan>el</expan></name></l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="F24">F<expan>er</expan>c<expan>er</expan>tne</name> re <name type="person" nymRef="F24">Labr<expan>aid</expan> Lorc</name></l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="M39">Mogh Ruith</name> is <name type="person" nymRef="F58"><expan>Find</expan> Fǣb<expan>ur</expan>no<expan>ch</expan>t</name>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="31">
<l>Cūig<expan>er</expan> ba gǣithi, um ceil ng<expan>r</expan>in<expan>n</expan>,</l>
<l>do bhí a n<expan>n</expan>-ǣi<expan>n</expan>tigh a <name type="place" nymRef="e6">nĒir<expan>inn</expan></name></l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="F79">Fíth<expan>al</expan></name> ⁊ <name type="person" nymRef="F84">Flaithri</name> a mhac</l>
  <l><name type="person" nymRef="A58">Aillmhe</name> ⁊ <name type="person" nymRef="C10">Cairb<expan>r</expan>e</name> is <name type="person" nymRef="C98">Cormac</name>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="32">  
<l>IN ceisd do chuirdis t<expan>r</expan>ē cēill</l>
<l>p<expan>r</expan>ap ro ḟūasl<expan>uca</expan>d <name type="person" nymRef="F64"><expan>Find</expan></name> fē<expan>in</expan></l>
<l>i<expan>n</expan> ceisd do-níth <name type="person" nymRef="F64"><expan>Find</expan></name> na fl<expan>ed</expan>h</l>
<l>n<expan>e</expan>ch don <expan>chúiger</expan> ní chuimhgeadh?</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="33">
<l><expan>Cúiger</expan> lǣch luaidhi<expan>uis</expan> f<expan>er</expan>ga</l>
<l>is f<expan>er</expan>r thā<expan>r</expan>uill <name type="place" nymRef="i2">īath Ealga</name></l>
<l>budh gai<expan>r</expan>be gnī<expan>m</expan> ⁊ glo<expan>n</expan>n</l>
<l>bhudh gai<expan>r</expan>gi a cath 's a comhlon<expan>n</expan>.</l></lg>

  
<lg type="quatrain" n="34">  
<l><name type="person" nymRef="L35">Lugh m<expan>a</expan>c Cēi<expan>n</expan> <expan>meic</expan> Cāi<expan>n</expan>ti</name> anall</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="C113">Cū Chul<expan>ainn</expan></name> ⁊ <name type="person" nymRef="C72"><expan>Con</expan>all</name></l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="L37">Lughaidh Lāgha</name>, lāmh a<expan>r</expan> ghoil,</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="F64">Fin<expan>n</expan> fēi<expan>n</expan> ō Baīscne</name> ba<expan>r</expan>rghloi<expan>n</expan>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="35">
<l>Cūig<expan>er</expan> is fēle f<expan>r</expan>īth rīa<expan>m</expan></l>
<l>b<expan>ud</expan>h ḟe<expan>r</expan>r u<expan>m</expan> b<expan>r</expan>at is um biadh</l>
<l>do cinedh na <name type="place" nymRef="g2"><expan>n</expan>Gaīg<expan>el</expan></name> nglē</l>
<l>maith ro chaiths<expan>e</expan>t a maíne.</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="36">
<l><name type="person" nymRef="L35">Lugh m<expan>a</expan>c Ethne</name>, <name type="person" nymRef="A34">Ǣ<expan>n</expan>g<expan>us</expan></name> án,</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="C113">Cū Chul<expan>ainn</expan></name>, ba lǣchdha lāmh,</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="C71"><expan>Con</expan>ai<expan>r</expan>e</name> cǣ<expan>m</expan>, c<expan>r</expan>uth nār’ clǣi,</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="F64">Fin<expan>n</expan></name>, <name type="person" nymRef="M4">M<expan>a</expan>c Lughach</name> a<expan>r</expan> ǣnchǣi.</l></lg>

  
<lg type="quatrain" n="37">
<l>Cūig<expan>er</expan> flatha, fīrtha<expan>r</expan> lea<expan>m</expan>,</l>
<l>as f<expan>er</expan>r tā<expan>r</expan>uill īath <name type="place" nymRef="e6">nĒir<expan>enn</expan></name></l>
<l>as meabai<expan>r</expan> lea<expan>m</expan>-sa co be<expan>cht</expan></l>
<l>a faisnēis ’na fl<expan>aith</expan>imhe<expan>cht</expan>.</l></lg>
 
<lg type="quatrain" n="38">
<l><name type="person" nymRef="E41">Ēirimō<expan>n</expan> m<expan>a</expan>c Mīl<expan>ed</expan> mōir</name></l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="U12">Ūghai<expan>n</expan>e</name> d’ēis <name type="person" nymRef="E41">Ēirimōi<expan>n</expan></name></l>
<l><pb xml:id="Stokes_p.73"/><name type="person" nymRef="A40">Ǣ<expan>n</expan>ghas T<expan>ur</expan>m<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan></name>, ba t<expan>r</expan>ēn gail,</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="C86"><expan>Con</expan>n <expan>Céd</expan>chathach</name>, <name type="person" nymRef="F64"><expan>Find</expan></name> fortail.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="39">  
<l>Lǣch ar ghai<expan>r</expan>bhe, sā<expan>r</expan>gnīm lon<expan>n</expan>,</l>
<l>⁊ ōclǣch a<expan>r</expan> chumond</l>
<l>clēir<expan>e</expan>c<expan>h</expan> a<expan>r</expan> p<expan>r</expan>oiceapt M<expan>ei</expan>c Dhé</l>
<l>⁊ flaith a<expan>r</expan> fīri<expan>n</expan>ne.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="40">
<l>Nī ḟ<expan>ed</expan>a<expan>r</expan> locht a<expan>r</expan> fēi<expan>n</expan>n fi<expan>n</expan>n</l>
<l>da<expan>r</expan> i<expan>n</expan> Rí ḟuil ōs mu ci<expan>nn</expan></l>
<l>acht a Dhē t<expan>ur</expan>aill talma<expan>n</expan>,</l>
<l>gan i<expan>n</expan> M<expan>a</expan>c do mōradhradh.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="41"> 
<l>Nī mha<expan>r</expan>at in <expan>muindter</expan> mhaith</l>
<l>ní mha<expan>r</expan>u<expan>nn</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="F64"><expan>Find</expan></name> in fīrḟlaith</l>
<l>ní ḟuil i<expan>n</expan> cuiri ’na thigh</l>
<l>’mo<expan>n</expan> ruiri ’mo<expan>n</expan> rīghḟēin<expan>nid</expan>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="42">  
<l>F<expan>er</expan>r a s<expan>r</expan>eatha i<expan>n</expan>ā g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> s<expan>r</expan>eath.</l>
<l>ferr inā g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> t<expan>r</expan>īath a taīsech<note><p>Tá imeall na lámhscríbhinne in easnamh; mar sin, tá na línte deiridh ar lár.</p></note></l>
<l>mēt a co<expan>n</expan> ⁊ a bhfer,</l>
<l>mēt a scīath is a cl[...].</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="43"> 
<l>Ba rī, ba fāidh, ba file,</l>
<l>ba t<expan>r</expan>īath co mē[t mōrḟine]</l>
<l>a<expan>r</expan> nd<expan>r</expan>aī ’s a<expan>r</expan> fisidh ’sa<expan>r</expan> fāidh</l>
<l>fa bi<expan>n</expan>n li<expan>n</expan>[d cach ní do ráid].</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="44">  
<l>"Gidh mōr lib mo teisd", a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="F64"><expan>Find</expan>,</name></l>
<l>da<expan>r</expan> i<expan>n</expan> Rī [ḟuil os mo chind],</l>
<l>f<expan>er</expan>r-so<expan>m</expan> fo t<expan>r</expan>ī, co<expan>m</expan>oll nglē,</l>
<l>gidh m[ōr in ní rāidim-sí].</l></lg>
  
<lg type="quatrain" n="45"><pb edRef="Lis204" n="fol.218r"/><cb edRef="Lis204" n="fol.218ra"/> 
<l>Gu bha .uii. do c<expan>r</expan>eit in rī,</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="F64"><expan>Find</expan> m<expan>a</expan>c Cumhaill</name> <name type="place" nymRef="a13">Almhai<expan>n</expan>i</name>,</l>
<l>in <expan>sechtmad</expan> fecht ro bhoí a<expan>r</expan> fás,</l>
<l>as de tāi<expan>n</expan>ic a thiug<expan>bás</expan>.</l></lg>

<lg type="quatrain" n="46">
<l><name type="place" nymRef="l32">Leath Mogha</name> ag <name type="person" nymRef="E34">Eōg<expan>an</expan></name> do boī</l>
<l><name type="person" nymRef="T13">T<expan>r</expan>ēnmōr</name> is re lāi<expan>m</expan> ro bhoī</l>
<l>m<expan>a</expan>c dhō <name type="person" nymRef="C17">Cai<expan>r</expan>ill</name> Cnuic i<expan>n</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="S7">Scāil</name>,</l>
<l>fa bi<expan>n</expan>n leis g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> nī do rāidh’. <expan>Rāidh</expan></l></lg>
</p>

  <p>‘Adrӕ <expan>búaid</expan> ⁊ <expan>bennachtain</expan>, a <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Chaīl<expan>ti</expan></name>,’, 
    a<expan>r</expan> <name type="person" nymRef="D25">Dīa<expan>r</expan>m<expan>ait</expan> m<expan>a</expan>c C<expan>er</expan>b<expan>aill</expan></name>, 
    ‘⁊ cāit a fuileat s<expan>uíth</expan>i ⁊ sench<expan>aid</expan>i <name type="place" nymRef="e6">Ēir<expan>enn</expan></name> 
    sc<expan>r</expan>ībhtha<expan>r</expan> i tamlorcaibh fil<expan>ed</expan> ⁊ i sleachtaibh sūadh ⁊ a mb<expan>r</expan>īat<expan>r</expan>aibh 
    ollumhu<expan>n</expan> co mb<expan>ér</expan>i cach a chuid lais da c<expan>r</expan>īch ⁊ da f<expan>er</expan>a<expan>n</expan>n, 
    da g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> ḟis ⁊ da g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> ḟor<expan>us</expan> ⁊ da g<expan>a</expan>c<expan>h</expan> 
    dhi<expan>n</expan>nsench<expan>us</expan> ⁊ do<expan>n</expan>a gnī<expan>m</expan>uibh gaili ⁊ <expan>gaiscid</expan>?’.</p>
  <p>Do in<expan>n</expan>is <name type="person" nymRef="C6">Caīl<expan>ti</expan></name> ⁊ <name type="person" nymRef="O2">Oisī<expan>n</expan></name>,
    ⁊ do-gnīth amhl<expan>aidh</expan>.</p>
</body>
